queue tag, style, beta, seed, deploy_every, regime, pscale, anchor, pop, eps, gamma, wplat, mode, canary, eps_ai, gatemode, iclk, snap, uselora, fresh, ansk, gg, nrounds, cmode from experiments/condor/configs_pofd_mistral_innate_clamp_graph_s0.txt
